---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | TOOLBOXS"
  description="Terms of Service and Conditions of Use for TOOLBOXS financial calculator platform."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Terms of Service', url: '/terms-of-service' },
  ]}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16 space-y-8 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
    <div class="space-y-3 border-b border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 pb-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/70 border border-emerald-200/80 dark:border-emerald-800/80 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 shadow-xs">
        <span>📜 Legal Terms</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated: Fiscal Year 2026</p>
    </div>

    <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 bg-white dark:bg-[#0F172A] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-card-light dark:shadow-none space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using TOOLBOXS, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our services.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 bg-white dark:bg-[#0F172A] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-card-light dark:shadow-none space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Educational & Illustrative Scope</h2>
      <p>
        The tools, calculators, tax rates, and results provided on this website are intended solely for general informational and educational planning purposes. They do not constitute certified tax, legal, accounting, or professional financial advice.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 bg-white dark:bg-[#0F172A] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-card-light dark:shadow-none space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        Under no circumstances shall TOOLBOXS or its contributors be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use the tools or materials provided on this platform.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
